                <p>For text of Ambassador Harriman’s letter of April 8 to Foreign Commissar Molotov,
                    see <ref target="frus1945Berlinv01#pg_743">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Conference of Berlin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
